            <title>2.7.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 15:38:32 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sriinnu/Runic/main/appcast.xml</link>
            <sparkle:version>115</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.7.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Runic 2.7.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>Menu: <strong>Refresh</strong> on a brand with International and China accounts (Kimi, z.ai, MiniMax, Qwen, StepFun) fetches every region you have enabled. The brand tab points at the international slot, so Refresh only re-fetched that one: a China-only account never updated, and with both only the international card did. Opening the menu now also re-pings when any region under the tab is stale or failing, not just the international one.</li>
<li>Menu: <strong>Dashboard</strong>, <strong>Status page</strong> and <strong>Export CSV/JSON</strong> act on the region the brand tab actually shows. A China-only Kimi opens platform.moonshot.cn instead of the international console and exports its own usage instead of the empty international slot.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://github.com/sriinnu/Runic/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">View full changelog</a></p>
]]></description>
